{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/Logo_Final_1__sm.png?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pulsar Crash is a 2D twin-stick shooter which throws you into head-to-head space battles where the competitive spirit of fighting games meets bullet-hell chaos.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/clip2.gif?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face off in intense multiplayer showdowns with up to four players!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control agile starships with distinct abilities and crush your enemies in top-down, arena-style combat in a thrilling space-western setting, with an over-the-top visual style and an electrifying funk/fusion soundtrack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/clip5.gif?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your pilot. Master your play style.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight pilots each with unique core abilities tailored for aggressive brawlers, agile tacticians, and everything in between.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/clip6.gif?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize your loadout\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully select a secondary weapon to pair with your pilot. Collect Pulsar Orbs during the match to use your secondary weapon and unique ship ability!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/clip4.gif?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle across five dynamic stages\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stages are divided into multiple maps, with each round taking place on a new map. Each stage is designed around a central easy-to-understand, challenging-to-master mechanic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/clip3.gif?t=1752202903\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Local chaos, global competition\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your next game night a hit with frantic 4-player free for all, prove yourself in hyper-competitive head-to-head local matches, or find online matches through our Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/extras/Little-DrWhite_sm.png?t=1752202903\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1295290?t=1752202903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1295290?t=1752202903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/4f26bce0ddb3f2e12e2a8b942e28a3fa081d5eb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752202903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1295290/4f26bce0ddb3f2e12e2a8b942